"Код сообщения об ошибке. Возможные варианты: ``INCORRECT_DATA``, "
"``USER_NOT_FOUND``, ``TASK_NOT_FOUND``"
msgstr ""
"Error message code. Possible values: ``INCORRECT_DATA``, "
"``USER_NOT_FOUND``, ``TASK_NOT_FOUND``"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:450
#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:453
msgid "``task_name``"
msgstr "``task_name``"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:451
#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:454
msgid "Название задачи"
msgstr "Task name"

#: ../../settings_kb/notifications/notification_lazy_approval.rst:457
msgid ""
"Код сообщения об ошибке. Возможные варианты: ``TASK_ALREADY_COMPLETED``, "
"``OUTCOME_NOT_FOUND``, ``TOKEN_NOT_FOUND``, ``EXCEPTION``"
